{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33764","headline":"秋夜有怀 · 皮日休","name":"秋夜有怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梦里忧身泣，觉来衣尚湿。\n骨肉煎我心，不是谋生急。\n如何欲佐主，功名未成立。\n处世既孤特，传家无承袭。\n明朝走梁楚，步步出门涩。\n如何一寸心，千愁万愁入。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33764.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33764","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}